No third-party Rust crates are vendored: src/rust/vendor.tar.xz carries only the hypertabular core and the hypercast crate it judges every cell with, both the work of this package's authors (Skunk Werkx, MIT), but for the Unicode data below.
The vendored hypercast crate's case folding (unicode/CaseFolding-17.0.0.txt and src/fold_table.rs, generated from it) is from the Unicode Character Database, (c) Unicode, Inc., Unicode License v3: https://www.unicode.org/license.txt
